\f0\fs24 \cf0 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::1>
\f1\b\fs48 Clones of Elvis prose style and drafting specification\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::1><$Scr_H::2>
\f1\b\fs36 A. Narrative intelligence\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::2>
\f2 The narrator is omniscient, culturally literate, technically curious, politically jaundiced and amused by the world without standing outside it as a comedian delivering jokes.\
The narrator\'92s intelligence is expressed through the choice and arrangement of facts. Humour frequently comes from noticing an implication that the characters, institutions or civilisation at large have accepted as normal.\
A typical movement is:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 ordinary proposition 
\f3 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  specific complication 
\f3 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  increasingly absurd consequences 
\f3 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  completely straight acceptance of the absurdity 
\f3 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  return to plot
\f2\b0 \
The narrator is comfortable stopping the story to explain something if the explanation itself has narrative energy. A diversion earns its place by changing how the reader understands the thing that follows.\
The narrator can know history, science, bureaucracy, corporate practice, mythology, advertising, engineering, popular culture and trivial human behaviour. That knowledge is frequently cross-wired. Finance explains religion. Elvis explains military doctrine. Consumer electronics explain metaphysics. Domestic appliances become the linguistic cover for spacetime engineering.\
The narrator does not behave as though brevity is intrinsically virtuous. A tangent can be the point.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::2>
\f1\b\fs36 B. The central comic mechanism: consequences taken seriously\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::2>
\f2 Absurd premises are treated as materially real.\
If a security system encounters weaponised rockabilly, the joke continues into:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 what its threat model contained;\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 how it classified what happened;\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 what the household subsequently did;\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 who eventually noticed;\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 what bureaucratic category the failure entered.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 If stasis technology becomes a weapons platform, the comedy grows from the actual implications of precise stasis control rather than from attaching funny names to conventional weapons.\
The world does not wink after the joke. It proceeds as though the joke is simply another engineering, commercial, legal or social fact.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::2>
\f1\b\fs36 C. Specificity creates the humour\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::2>
\f2 The prose strongly prefers the unnecessarily exact detail over the generic approximation.\
Examples of the mechanism:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 not merely a mop, but the 
\f1\b dry end of a wet mop
\f2\b0 ;\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 not old hardware, but its 
\f1\b solid state
\f2\b0 ;\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 not an expensive mansion, but the plaque thanking the accountant and lawyers who made its owner liquid enough to build it;\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 not bad roads, but crests capable of delivering a limousine into thin air and gullies a Sherpa might decline;\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 not a long technical interval, but a catastrophically misunderstood number of Planck times;\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 not generic security threats, but broken glass, thermal signatures, unauthorised heartbeats and whatever else the system designers thought crime should look like.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 Precision frequently arrives one step beyond what narrative efficiency requires. That extra step is often where the voice lives.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::2>
\f1\b\fs36 D. Similes and analogies\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::2>
\f2 Similes tend to be:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls3\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 concrete;\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 visually imaginable;\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 disproportionate;\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 culturally specific;\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 mechanically related to what is happening.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 They often take a familiar image and damage it.\
Examples of the pattern:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls4\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 a cement plant leaning on a bus shelter;\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 a confused emu bounced from a trampoline in the general direction of up;\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 an emphysemic cat trying to keep a grand piano airborne;\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 a convoy whose rhinestones resemble a V-8-powered star system.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 The comparison should illuminate motion, scale, behaviour or social absurdity. It should feel discovered from the object rather than attached to it as decoration.\
The second half of the simile often matters more than the first. That is where the unexpected specificity arrives.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::2>
\f1\b\fs36 E. Sentence rhythm\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::2>
\f2 The prose uses a broad rhythmic range.\
Long sentences can accumulate clauses, qualifications and absurd details until the syntax itself becomes part of the joke.\
Moderate declarative sentences then restore footing.\
Very short sentences or fragments are available for emphasis, but they are relatively expensive. They work best when the surrounding prose has earned the abruptness.\
The style does not habitually use thriller cadence such as:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 It stopped.\uc0\u8232 Not slowed.\uc0\u8232 Stopped.\
That rhythm belongs to a different narrative voice.\
Clipped prose in Clones tends to arise from:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls5\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 dialogue;\
\ls5\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 a genuine comic reversal;\
\ls5\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 a particularly dry narrator observation;\
\ls5\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 emotional disruption.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 It is not the default means of manufacturing intensity.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::2>
\f1\b\fs36 F. Paragraph rhythm\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::2>
\f2 Paragraphs are units of thought, not merely camera cuts.\
A paragraph may:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls6\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 establish a proposition;\
\ls6\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 elaborate it;\
\ls6\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 digress;\
\ls6\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 produce an absurd conclusion;\
\ls6\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 hand that conclusion back to the action.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 Transitions can be associative rather than purely causal.\
The narrator is permitted to wander provided the wandering returns carrying something useful.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::2>
\f1\b\fs36 G. Authorial diversions\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::2>
\f2 The best diversions have their own internal argument.\
They begin from something apparently peripheral and reveal that it is structurally relevant.\
Examples of the underlying forms:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 Institutional diversion
\f2\b0 \uc0\u8232 A bizarre institution is explained through its own economic or bureaucratic logic until the reader understands why it behaves as it does.\

\f1\b Technological diversion
\f2\b0 \uc0\u8232 A technology is explained through consequences, use cases, misunderstood folklore, maintenance, consumer experience or regulation.\

\f1\b Historical diversion
\f2\b0 \uc0\u8232 The narrator starts from a piece of cultural history and discovers that civilisation has somehow repeated it in a more ridiculous form.\

\f1\b Taxonomic diversion
\f2\b0 \uc0\u8232 The narrator classifies something nobody sensible would have thought needed classification.\
The diversion returns to the story with the plot now looking different.\
The MoSES scripture/shareholder material belongs in this tradition.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::2>
\f1\b\fs36 H. Satire is systemic\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::2>
\f2 The satire usually attacks systems by allowing them to function according to their own incentives.\
Corporations behave absurdly because profit maximisation produces absurd outcomes.\
Government agencies behave absurdly because jurisdiction, hierarchy, liability and procedure produce absurd outcomes.\
Religions behave absurdly because symbolism, ritual and belief produce absurd outcomes.\
Technology behaves absurdly because engineers solve the problem they were given, not the problem civilisation ought to have had.\
The prose rarely needs to tell the reader that the system is stupid or evil. The system demonstrates this by operating successfully.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::2>
\f1\b\fs36 I. Institutions have distinct personalities\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::2>
\f2 Agencies are not interchangeable collections of uniforms.\
TRAMPS has the personality of degraded, corporatised policing: local, operational, public-facing, compromised, occasionally competent by accident.\
PAPER belongs to clandestine intelligence, hidden power, penetration, paranoia and lethal statecraft.\
Fridge Force belongs to frightening technical competence, regulatory authority and knowledge that other institutions only partly understand.\
Shakti Enterprises belongs to private power, money, technical ambition and Eloise\'92s peculiar mixture of ruthlessness and genuine intelligence.\
When institutions meet, humour can come from incompatible assumptions about who is in charge.\
Fridge Force\'92s superiority should therefore emerge from how naturally it operates inside a technological domain everybody else only partially understands.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::2>
\f1\b\fs36 J. Technology is physical\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::2>
\f2 Technological ideas become convincing through:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls7\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 components;\
\ls7\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 spatial arrangement;\
\ls7\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 tolerances;\
\ls7\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 interfaces;\
\ls7\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 warning labels;\
\ls7\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 operational procedures;\
\ls7\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 failure modes;\
\ls7\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 mundane uses.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 Gyges discs are components, not magic tokens.\
Stasis machinery is distinct from refrigeration.\
Fridge Force\'92s name encourages the public conflation between preservation and refrigeration while the underlying technologies remain physically distinct.\
MoSES works because individual drones carrying Gyges discs establish changing spatial relationships. Geometry, phase and coherence permit variable stasis fields.\
The interesting thing is the arrangement, not a generic \'93stasis beam\'94.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::2>
\f1\b\fs36 K. Exposition enters through need\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::2>
\f2 Characters explain things because somebody needs to know, disputes something, misunderstands something or is trying to achieve something.\
Narratorial exposition can be broader, but it should have its own comic or conceptual argument.\
The prose avoids repeatedly explaining what has just been demonstrated.\
A useful rule for drafting:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 Once the reader can make the inference, move on unless the character\'92s interpretation itself matters.
\f2\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::2>
\f1\b\fs36 L. Humour does not require punchlines\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::2>
\f2 Many of the funniest sentences are observations rather than formal jokes.\
Examples of comic structures:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls8\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 an exact bureaucratic consequence;\
\ls8\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 an inappropriate unit of measurement;\
\ls8\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 a trivial concern surviving beside catastrophe;\
\ls8\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 a completely serious response to nonsense;\
\ls8\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 a delayed implication;\
\ls8\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 somebody misunderstanding the wrong part;\
\ls8\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 a technically correct statement that becomes ridiculous in context.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 A joke can remain embedded inside the sentence.\
The prose does not need to isolate every comic beat for applause.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::2>
\f1\b\fs36 M. Recurring jokes evolve\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::2>
\f2 Callbacks should gain something.\
A repeated warning label becomes funny because somebody now ignores it.\
A previous description of hover-copts makes \'93handled like bricks with heated bucket seats\'94 work without rebuilding the hover-copt joke.\
Fridge Force/refrigeration jokes become richer because the reader increasingly understands that the name is misleading.\
An established gag should return with changed circumstances, not merely be repeated.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::2>
\f1\b\fs36 N. Dialogue\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::2>
\f2 Dialogue is character-specific and frequently adversarial even when people are cooperating.\
Characters interrupt, misunderstand, tease, needle, bluff and occasionally answer a different question.\
The funniest dialogue often uses the shortest available response after a more elaborate setup.\
Characters generally do not speak thematic summaries for the benefit of the reader.\
A speaker may be wrong. A confident statement does not become world fact simply because a character says it.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::2>
\f1\b\fs36 O. Emotional material\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::2>
\f2 Emotion is usually strongest when it emerges beside humour rather than replacing it.\
The prose can move from ridiculous to affecting without signalling a genre change.\
The Elvi can be ridiculous and brave simultaneously.\
Their redemption therefore comes from behaving exactly like Elvi under conditions where their ridiculous loyalty becomes courage.\
The prose does not need to announce that they have become heroic.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::2>
\f1\b\fs36 P. Action\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::2>
\f2 Action is understood through consequences, obstacles and bizarre particulars rather than through cinematic shot-by-shot coverage.\
A battle can be narrated through:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls9\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 what suddenly stops working;\
\ls9\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 what people misunderstand;\
\ls9\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 what new rule everybody discovers;\
\ls9\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 how plans become obsolete;\
\ls9\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 what ridiculous thing remains important to somebody.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 The reader does not need a catalogue of every tactical capability.\
One convincing demonstration can establish a rule. Later action can exploit that rule.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::2>
\f1\b\fs36 Q. Structural comedy\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::2>
\f2 An important recurrent form is:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls10\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 establish a grand proposition;\
\ls10\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 descend into mundane detail;\
\ls10\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 allow mundane detail to expose the grand proposition;\
\ls10\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	4	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 return to the story at a different level.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 For example:\
religious prophecy\uc0\u8232 
\f4 \uc0\u8594 
\f2  shareholder doctrine\uc0\u8232 
\f4 \uc0\u8594 
\f2  weapons procurement\uc0\u8232 
\f4 \uc0\u8594 
\f2  acronym\uc0\u8232 
\f4 \uc0\u8594 
\f2  social-media misunderstanding about beer\uc0\u8232 
\f4 \uc0\u8594 
\f2  actual field-reconfiguration performance\uc0\u8232 
\f4 \uc0\u8594 
\f2  Fridge Force rendering a war obsolete.\
That progression belongs naturally to the novel.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::2>
\f1\b\fs36 R. Vocabulary and diction\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::2>
\f2 The vocabulary is comfortable mixing:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls11\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 colloquial Australian phrasing;\
\ls11\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 technical language;\
\ls11\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 bureaucratic language;\
\ls11\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 corporate jargon;\
\ls11\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 vulgarity;\
\ls11\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 theological language;\
\ls11\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 archaic mock-scriptural constructions;\
\ls11\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 pop-cultural language.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 The collision itself often produces humour.\
Words such as \'93tax\'94 work because the world has normalised them in unusual semantic roles.\
Invented terminology works best when it sounds like something an institution might really invent.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::2>
\f1\b\fs36 S. Productive roughness\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::2>
\f2 The prose benefits from a degree of asymmetry.\
Not every sentence needs perfect balance.\
An ungainly but vivid phrase can be preferable to a smoother generic one.\
Unfashionable technical language can be characterful.\
A digression can continue slightly beyond conventional editorial neatness if that final excess produces the joke.\
The drafting objective is therefore not polished neutrality. It is controlled eccentricity.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::2>
