\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 What inference can the reader make without assistance?\
\ls12\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	9	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Which characters or institutions gain something new?\
